// card render-as: a `to` phrase names its result type after `as` (Features.md, D10 notes/dispatch.md)
class pdf{body:text}
class docx{body:text}

to render text as pdf:
	return pdf("%PDF " + text)

to render text as docx:
	return docx("<w:t>" + text + "</w:t>")

result = (render "hello") as pdf
print type of result
print result.body

docx example = render "hello MS"
print example.body
